{
  "info": {
    "name": "buzzd",
    "description": "HTTP endpointi buzzd servera i uputstvo za WebSocket.\n\n## WebSocket\n\nPostman ne čuva WebSocket zahteve u JSON fajlu kolekcije, pa se prave ručno (jednom):\n\n1. **New → WebSocket**, URL: `{{wsUrl}}/ws?token={{token1}}` (igrač 1). Sačuvaj ga u ovu kolekciju.\n2. Isto za `{{token2}}` (igrač 2) i `{{token3}}` (posmatrač).\n3. U svakom WebSocket zahtevu, pod **Saved messages**, sačuvaj poruke ispod.\n\nRedosled: pokreni **Create room**, pa **Join** zahteve (oni upisuju tokene u varijable kolekcije), pa se u roku od 30 s poveži preko WebSocket-a.\n\n### Poruke\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"choose_color\", \"color\": \"white\" }\n{ \"type\": \"choose_color\", \"color\": \"black\" }\n{ \"type\": \"choose_color\", \"color\": \"random\" }\n{ \"type\": \"ready\" }\n{ \"type\": \"unready\" }\n{ \"type\": \"move\", \"move\": { \"type\": \"place\", \"piece\": \"ant\", \"to\": { \"q\": 0, \"r\": 0 } } }\n{ \"type\": \"move\", \"move\": { \"type\": \"move\", \"from\": { \"q\": 0, \"r\": 0 }, \"to\": { \"q\": 1, \"r\": 0 } } }\n{ \"type\": \"move\", \"move\": { \"type\": \"pass\" } }\n{ \"type\": \"resign\" }\n{ \"type\": \"leave\" }\n```\n\nLegalne poteze za trenutno stanje server šalje u polju `legalMoves` (u `match_started`, `match_state` i `move_played`), pa se jedan od njih može prekopirati u `move` poruku.\n\n### Negativni slučajevi\n\n- token koji ne postoji → konekcija se zatvara kodom `4001`\n- povezivanje posle isteka roka od 30 s → `4003`\n- `move` kad nisi na redu → `{ \"type\": \"error\", \"message\": \"Not your turn\" }`\n- nelegalan potez → `Illegal move`\n- `choose_color` tokom meča → `Match is in progress`\n- bilo koja poruka od posmatrača → `Spectators can only watch`\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "wsUrl",
      "value": "ws://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "roomId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token1",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token2",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token3",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/healthz",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "healthz"
          ]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test(\"status ok\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql(\"ok\"));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rooms",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create room (public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rooms",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "rooms"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pravi sobu i upisuje njen id u varijablu `roomId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"visibility\": \"public\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"ima roomId\", () => pm.expect(body.roomId).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"roomId\", body.roomId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
